---
import DiagramMap from "../components/DiagramMap.tsx";
---

<html lang="ja">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/png"
			sizes="32x32"
			href="/icon_flex_rail_way_map.png"
		/>
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>路線図モード（準備中） - フレックス路線図</title>
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
		<style>
			*, *::before, *::after {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			html, body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				overflow: hidden;
				font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
				background: #fff;
			}
			#root {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
			}
			/* ヘッダー */
			#header {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				height: 40px;
				background: #222;
				color: #fff;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				padding: 0 12px;
				z-index: 100;
				font-size: 13px;
			}
			#header a {
				color: #aaa;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 12px;
			}
			#header a:hover {
				color: #fff;
			}
			#map-container {
				position: fixed;
				top: 40px;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				bottom: 0;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div id="header">
			<span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:text-bottom;margin-right:4px"><path d="M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z"/><path d="M15 5.764v15"/><path d="M9 3.236v15"/></svg>路線図モード <span style="background:#e67e00;color:#fff;font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle;"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:text-bottom;margin-right:3px"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="8" rx="1"/><path d="M17 14v7M7 14v7M17 3v3M7 3v3M10 14 2.3 20.3M14 6l7.7-5.7M8 6l8 8M16 6l-8 8"/></svg>準備中</span> — 並走路線分離SVG路線図（仮実装）</span>
			<a href="/">← フレックス路線図に戻る</a>
		</div>
		<div id="map-container">
			<DiagramMap client:only="react" />
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
